---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - projecttrack.dev" description="Why this project track exists and who built it.">
  <article class="about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Why this track exists</h1>

    <p>
      I went through a UK data science degree, taught in Bahrain. The coursework was solid on theory: statistics,
      the math behind the models, the algorithms. It was thin on the part that actually gets you hired, which is
      building something real, end to end, and being able to talk through it in an interview.
    </p>

    <p>
      So I built that part myself. Outside of coursework, on my own schedule, I picked projects, finished them, and
      kept a record of what I did and why. That self-driven work, not the degree by itself, is what made me
      employable. This track is the same map I used, written down so the next cohort does not have to figure it out
      cold.
    </p>

    <p>
      I lean toward finance. I am a CFA Level I candidate, and that shows in the track: projects 8 through 11 are
      finance projects, and they come late in the order on purpose, after the foundations and the vision work are
      already in place.
    </p>

    <p>
      One more thing worth saying plainly: this is my own project track, built from my own experience. It is not
      any institution's curriculum, and finishing it is not endorsed by anyone but me.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 5vw 120px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.2vw, 46px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }
  p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }
  p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
